# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

# Project Name
Scrapper

---

# Overview

Scrapper is a fully free mobile application that automatically scrapes opportunity/job/internship data once every day without requiring any paid server or VPS.

The system must continue updating data even when the developer’s laptop is turned OFF.

The architecture should use:
- GitHub Actions for automation
- Python scraping scripts
- JSON-based storage
- GitHub repository as free hosting
- Flutter frontend for displaying data

The entire system should remain:
- serverless
- scalable
- low-maintenance
- zero-cost

---

# Objectives

## Primary Goals

- Automatically scrape data daily
- Avoid paid servers/VPS/cloud hosting
- Keep system fully free
- Ensure app works even when laptop is OFF
- Make architecture scalable for future scraping sources
- Provide reliable JSON data feed for mobile app

---

# Core Architecture

```text
GitHub Actions
      ↓
Runs Python Scraper Daily
      ↓
Updates JSON Files
      ↓
Commits JSON to GitHub Repo
      ↓
Flutter App Fetches Latest JSON
```
